  "limitations": [
    "One real run per version; active combat routes and naturally earned loot vary. No comparison of GPU execution, not a human dexterity/difficulty measurement. Browser rAF P95 remained 16.7 ms; view-update interval and rare long frames differ. Sample-duration differences preclude inferring fewer long frames causally.",
    "A2 old version defeated Lu Qian and showed result/rematch; baseline harness failed during new document before reload verification/hash sweep because of undeclared __snow identifier. No runtime failure was reported. B actual same route used window.__snow and verified saved record and 536 matched files.",
    "Battery temperature is battery sensor, not GPU. No CPU/GPU load control or browser process cache clearing; no inner screen, iOS, other Android or human speaker listening. Eight dialogue scheduled sources only.",
    "Joystick amplitude timing encountered road collision boundary in both; both actual movement directions worked, ratio is not a reliable control-speed measurement.",
    "Images use actual nearby game stage times; opening camera timing slightly differs and boss fights are not fixed-frame matching. New neutral snow and varied pavers improve readable cold/warm contrast; named bars are visible. Phone low model tier and overlay pixel-dense edge appearance are retained."
